---
import { MAIN_NAVIGATION } from '../../data/navigation';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<footer class="bg-surface-subtle border-t border-surface-border mt-20 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Brand column (spans 2 on large screens) -->
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4 group">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md shadow-brand-500/20">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 2L11 13"></path>
              <path d="M22 2L15 22L11 13L2 9L22 2Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-title">clash机机</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-sm">
          中文网络代理工具专业评测媒体。立足网络可观测性实验室，提供 41+ 专线机场横评、晚高峰测速丢包报告、流媒体与 ChatGPT 原生解锁矩阵及 Clash Verge 客户端配置教程。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <a href="/brands/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 bg-brand-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-200">
            <span>41 家品牌库</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-surface-border">
            <span>关于实验室</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/resources/methodology/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-surface-border">
            <span>评测白皮书</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation Columns -->
      {MAIN_NAVIGATION.map((section) => (
        <div class="col-span-1">
          <a href={section.href} class="text-xs font-bold text-ink-title uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">
            {section.title}
          </a>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {section.subItems.slice(0, 5).map((item) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={item.href}
                  class="text-xs text-ink-muted hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors block"
                >
                  {item.title}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
            <li>
              <a href={section.href} class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:underline">
                全部 7 个专题 »
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Disclosure & Disclaimer Box -->
    <div class="border-t border-surface-border pt-8 mb-8 space-y-3">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border text-xs text-ink-muted space-y-2">
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink-body font-semibold">商业合作与引介透明度披露 (Affiliate Disclosure)：</strong>
          本站部分链接包含服务商商业推广代码（使用合规 <code>rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"</code> 标记）。本站测评结果立足于自建网络监测节点对物理专线延迟、晚高峰丢包、流媒体解锁及资费性价比的客观实测，商业引介不改变独立评测结论。
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink-body font-semibold">法律与合规声明：</strong>
          请严格遵守您所在司法管辖区关于国际联网与网络安全的法律法规。本站所刊载的技术文章、开源客户端配置与测速数据仅供学术交流、企业跨境业务合规加速与技术实验研究使用，严禁利用任何工具从事违法犯罪活动。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom line -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-muted gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} clash机机 (clashairport.cc). 版权所有。</span>
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold text-ink-body">关于我们 (About Us)</a>
        <a href="/resources/methodology/" class="hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold text-ink-body">评测方法论 (Methodology)</a>
        <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-brand-600 underline" target="_blank">网站地图 (Sitemap)</a>
        <a href="/robots.txt" class="hover:text-brand-600 underline" target="_blank">Robots.txt</a>
        <a href="/brands/lightspeed/" class="hover:text-brand-600 font-semibold text-brand-600">光速云特惠</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>技术架构：Astro 静态引擎 + Pagefind 静态搜索 + Apache 部署</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
